{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/Banner.png?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The Shield of the Kingdom&quot; is a strategy + light action game, which sets itself apart from traditional tower defense games. In addition to supporting the classic rich pairing of heroes, skills, and troops, &quot;Shield of the Kingdom&quot; also offers extra features such as hero's signature gear  and movement in the battlefield . Beyond exploring and devising combat strategies to counter different types of enemy forces and bosses, players can also enjoy a unique gaming experience distinct from tradition through hero role transformations brought by signature gear, battlefield positioning, and the deployment of\u00a0reinforcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/\u5fae\u4fe1\u56fe\u7247_20250302175919.png?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, enemies will attack the player with unpredictable formations and strength.  Try different hero combinations and their skill synergies to fend off the enemies! Additionally, selecting the necessary allied troops to deploy can compensate for weaknesses in the battle situation, achieving twice the result with half the effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/main.gif?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/\u4e13\u5c5e\u88c5\u5907.png?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every hero has their own unique signature gear system, and each piece of signature gear can make the hero &quot;feel brand new,&quot; offering players additional ideas and solutions for building their lineups! Collecting all the signature gears for certain heroes can even increase their effects where one plus one is greater than two, awaiting players' development and exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/skill11.gif?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/skill22.gif?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/skill33.gif?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/\u64cd\u4f5c\u6027.png?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can maximize damage or effects by controlling one or more heroes. At the same time, by controlling the heroes' positioning, players can avoid damage, focus on key enemy units, or disrupt the enemy's advancing formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/export7.gif?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join &quot;The Shield of The Kingdom,\u00a0leading your team to write your own glorious chapter in this epic battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">QQ Group\uff1a743471834  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356810?t=1743416835","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356810?t=1743416835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/16d5b90822be13a9ade339322914f8c6e5345163/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743416835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/16d5b90822be13a9ade339322914f8c6e5345163/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743416835","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356810/extras/Banner.png?t=1743416835\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The Shield of the Kingdom&quot; is a strategy + light action game, which sets itself apart from traditional tower defense games. In addition to supporting the classic rich pairing of heroes, skills, and troops, &quot;Shield of the Kingdom&quot; also offers extra features such as hero's signature gear  and movement in the battlefield . Beyond exploring and devising combat strategies to counter different types of enemy forces and bosses, players can also enjoy a unique gaming experience distinct from tradition through hero role transformations brought by signature gear, battlefield positioning, and the deployment of\u00a0reinforcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/335681